OL,3,GNEWSALanes on M25 reopen after crash
OL,4,Abut delays remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree lanes on a section of the M25
OL,7,Fhave reopened after they were shut
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash involving a lorry and
OL,9,Fmotorbike that caused significant
OL,10,Fdelays.
OL,12,FNational Highways said shortly after
OL,13,F10:40 BST on Wednesday the carriageway
OL,14,Fbetween junction 12 (Thorpe) and
OL,15,Fjunction 13 (Staines) fully reopened.
OL,17,FThe agency added the vehicles involved
OL,18,Fin the collision have been moved to the
OL,19,Fhard shoulder to await recovery, and a
OL,20,Ffuel spillage has been successfully
OL,21,Ftreated.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
